- Athletes: /help/getting-started/athlete-start-here
- Businesses: /help/getting-started/business-start-here
- Either (sends each person to their own guide): /help/start-here$h$, '{}'::text[], $h$admin$h$, $h$live$h$, $h$help_center$h$, array[$h$admin$h$, $h$help center$h$, $h$articles$h$, $h$publish$h$, $h$edit$h$, $h$knowledge base$h$]::text[], '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], false, false, 0, '2026-09-27T00:00:00.000Z'::timestamptz)
